                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Chaos and the White Robot - platformer with memes, robots and with a huge description. Memes are fun for a couple of minutes, but then it's better to turn them off to play game normally (some jokes were lost in translation, so it's not a big deal anyway). Game is nicely drawn and well designed. I didn't like game controls though, it could've been more user friendly - constantly using acceleration for long jumps is not fun. The only bug i've encountered was falling through floor twice. Overall it's a nice indie platformer.",
